OL,3,GNEWSADouble yellows lines to tackle
OL,4,Afootball parking woes
OL,5,
OL,6,FDouble yellow lines have been painted
OL,7,Fon roads near a football club in
OL,8,FLeicestershire after residents said
OL,9,Fspectators' cars were blocking roads
OL,10,Fand pavements surrounding the ground.
OL,12,FAnstey Nomads Football club has
OL,13,Fexpanded from 20 teams to 60 in the
OL,14,Fpast five years, but people living
OL,15,Fnearby said there were parking issues
OL,16,Fon match and training days.
OL,18,FLeicestershire County Council
OL,19,Fintroduced "no waiting at any time"
OL,20,Fdouble yellow lines on parts of
OL,21,FCropston Road, King Williams Way, Rowan
OL,22,FDrive, and Link Road on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
